  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to meet operational costs of Caritas South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is one year project targeting the gaps related to the operational costs of the national office of Caritas South Sudan and is earmarked to address costs related to salary support costs, office rent and other office running costs/overheads. The support will ensure among others actively promoting engagement and participation of the various Caritas Sister Agencies as well as the diocesan Caritas offices in responding and addressing programme needs as well as humanitarian appeals.</narrative>
  </description>
